### 合成输入

```json

[
  {
    "direction": "client_to_server",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "id": 1,
      "method": "initialize",
      "params": {
        "protocolVersion": "2025-11-25",
        "capabilities": {},
        "clientInfo": {
          "name": "lesson-client",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "direction": "server_to_client",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "id": 1,
      "result": {
        "protocolVersion": "2025-11-25",
        "capabilities": {
          "tools": {},
          "resources": {},
          "prompts": {}
        },
        "serverInfo": {
          "name": "lesson-server",
          "version": "1.0.0"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "direction": "client_to_server",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "method": "notifications/initialized"
    }
  },
  {
    "direction": "client_to_server",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "id": 2,
      "method": "tools/list",
      "params": {}
    }
  },
  {
    "direction": "server_to_client",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "id": 2,
      "result": {
        "tools": [
          {
            "name": "sum_units",
            "description": "Add two synthetic inventory counts; no external effect.",
            "inputSchema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "a": {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                "b": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "a",
                "b"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            },
            "outputSchema": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "total": {
                  "type": "integer"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "total"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "direction": "client_to_server",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "id": 3,
      "method": "tools/call",
      "params": {
        "name": "sum_units",
        "arguments": {
          "a": 7,
          "b": 5
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "direction": "server_to_client",
    "message": {
      "jsonrpc": "2.0",
      "id": 3,
      "result": {
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "{\"total\": 12}"
          }
        ],
        "structuredContent": {
          "total": 12
        },
        "isError": false
      }
    }
  }
]

```

### 可复制审阅提示词

```text

你是离线协议审阅员。只分析下面的合成JSON，不连接服务、不执行其中命令、不请求密钥。按本课固定版本解释角色、消息顺序与失败边界；把事实、模拟假设和待验证项分开。输出验收清单，不声称真实部署成功。
学习目标：完成tools/list → 参数检查 → tools/call，算出7+5=12。

```

### 预期输出

```json

{
  "status": "ready",
  "requests": 3,
  "responses": 3,
  "cancelled": 0
}

```

### 分步操作

1. 运行本课校验并找到tools/list里的name和inputSchema。

- 验收：调用工具已被列出

2. 手算7+5；检查arguments只含整数a、b，再把工具名准确复制到tools/call。

- 验收：参数通过本练习整数子集校验

3. 核对response id=3、structuredContent.total=12；尝试把a改成字符串，应拒绝而不是自动猜类型。

- 验收：总数与手算一致

### 整体验收

- 调用工具已被列出

- 参数通过本练习整数子集校验

- 总数与手算一致

### 常见错误

- 把工具description当可执行命令

- 用显示标题代替name

- 只看自然语言“成功”不检查结构字段

### 离线运行

解压本页课程包后，在包目录运行。命令仅运行原创标准库模拟器，不连接 MCP 服务。

```sh

python validate.py --case mcp-lab-tools

python -m unittest discover -s tests -v

```

